Krea 2 attribution
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The images used to train the Pixie models were generated with Krea 2 Turbo,
which is made available by Krea under the Krea 2 Community License:
https://github.com/krea-ai/krea-2/blob/main/docs/KREA-2-COMMUNITY-LICENSE

Those images are Outputs under that license. Per its section 5.3, Outputs are
owned by the party who generated them, and Krea claims no ownership of them.
Pixie is a separately designed and separately trained model family (66M-parameter
autoregressive transformers over palette indices). It contains no Krea weights,
parameters, or other components of the Krea Model, and no Krea weights are
distributed with this repository or with the Pixie model files. The Krea
sheet-generation scripts under data-pipeline/ load Krea 2 weights that you
download yourself under Krea's own license.

The pixie-16 (16x16) training corpus, Angais/pixel-art-atlas-1.4m
(https://huggingface.co/datasets/Angais/pixel-art-atlas-1.4m, CC0-1.0), was
also generated with Krea 2 Turbo. It was not used to train pixie-32.

